# Monument to Endurance: a Monument that left the battlefield and came back is a new object (CR 400.7) with every mode to choose again. Masked Meower's discard makes the first Monument choose
# "Draw a card"; Boomerang Basics returns that Monument to hand and Bot1 casts it again; Lion's Eye Diamond's discard of two cards then triggers the new Monument twice, and it may choose
# "Draw a card" once more (the second trigger takes the Treasure). The Treasure and the draw are the new Monument's.

